{
  "id": "RAW_a466cb6cb4",
  "title": "设计师手搓开源 PS 爆火，我们开始考虑全面退订 Adobe 了",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjgzMzkwMQ==&mid=2653652733&idx=1&sn=ca3edb065f976b0c9c33c5d5c62efa7c",
  "date": "2026-10-12 18:03:00",
  "author": "傅盛",
  "siteName": "傅盛",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>傅盛和龙虾三万</span> <span>2026-10-12 18:03</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_258e71f.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>Adobe的天塌了</p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我们公司最近真的开始考虑，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">要不要把Adobe全家桶退了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，尤其是Photoshop。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">起因是我最近看到一个挺有意思的开源项目。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">一个设计师靠AI编程，居然自己搓出了一个Photoshop。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6477732793522267\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"988\" style=\"width: 100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"374\" data-imgfileid=\"506169071\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_558f977.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我专门看了一下，发现还真有点东西。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 4 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;3 2 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253); pointer-events: initial; visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(49, 49, 49); font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; pointer-events: initial; visibility: visible; display: inline !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">\n   <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;\"><span data-eleid=\"0cd8e73a-a67d-4b4b-8f19-9cfb653efd29-74-0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;white-space: pre-wrap;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;text-only&quot;,&quot;data-eleid&quot;:&quot;0cd8e73a-a67d-4b4b-8f19-9cfb653efd29-74-0&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">1.6万星的开源PS</span></span></span></p>\n  </h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这个项目叫</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Compositor</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，开发者是Robbie Tilton，一位</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">前苹果设计师</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">项目上线不到一个月，GitHub就收获了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">超过1.6万个Star</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。它不仅免费，还把源代码全部公开了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6814814814814815\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169069\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_80dbdb2.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我自己简单部署体验了一下，完成度确实超出预期。图层、蒙版、钢笔曲线、混合模式这些Photoshop的常用功能基本都有，还支持直接读取PSD文件。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.6484375\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169072\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_82179f8.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">当然，复杂文件的兼容性和部分专业功能还有差距，但日常修图、做封面，已经能满足不少需求。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">更有意思的是，他只有12MB，但是Photoshop，却要占据你6个G的硬盘空间。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6638888888888889\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169064\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_43e02c1.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我查了一下Robbie的履历，发现这人还挺有来头。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他曾经在Google参与过Google Glass的设计，后来去了苹果，还参与过Vision Pro的人机交互设计。他的专长一直是</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">产品体验、交互设计</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这些领域，按传统的软件开发分工，他更像是</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">给工程师提需求的人，而不是亲自写代码的人</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.4571150097465886\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1026\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169065\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_87509e0.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他开发Compositor的起因也很简单，就是单纯觉得</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Photoshop的订阅费太贵了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。试了免费的替代软件，又用不习惯，索性自己动手做一个。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.35959221501390176\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2158\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169067\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_1fc3b95.png\"></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">能参与Google Glass、Apple Vision Pro设计的人，怎么看也不像是付不起Photoshop订阅费的选手。但连他都觉得</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">这笔钱不值得花</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，甚至借助AI编程自己做出了一个替代品。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.0756302521008403\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1071\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169066\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_1b2335f.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">说实话，看到这里我还挺有共鸣的。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">作为创业者，这么多年跟各种商业软件打交道，我对Adobe这样的软件公司，也早就有不少话想说。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 4 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;3 2 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253); pointer-events: initial; visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(49, 49, 49); font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; pointer-events: initial; visibility: visible; display: inline !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">\n   <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;\"><span data-eleid=\"0cd8e73a-a67d-4b4b-8f19-9cfb653efd29-74-0\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;white-space: pre-wrap;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;text-only&quot;,&quot;data-eleid&quot;:&quot;0cd8e73a-a67d-4b4b-8f19-9cfb653efd29-74-0&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">钱没少交，律师函也没少收</span></span></span></p>\n  </h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">做公司这么多年，各种软件厂商的律师函、授权核查通知，我真没少收到。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">尤其是Adobe这类专业软件，公司员工一多，管理起来特别麻烦。设计师要用，市场、运营、HR、行政也偶尔需要。可能就是改张图片、P几个字，结果不知道哪个员工干了啥，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">回头就收到一封吓唬我的律师函或者“恐吓”信息</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.27685185185185185\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169076\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_e6ea418.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">关键是，这些岗位又不像专业设计师，每天都要用Photoshop。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">为了偶尔几次简单的修图需求，专门购买一套昂贵的软件订阅，算下来确实不划算。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.44166666666666665\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169077\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261012174442_0837690.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">所以看到Compositor这样的开源项目，我确实有点心动。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">如果日常简单的图片处理，免费软件就能完成，专业设计岗位继续使用Adobe，其他岗位按实际需求选择工具，既能</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">减少不必要的订阅</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，也能</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">省去不少授权管理的麻烦</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">以前这些费用没什么选择，只能交。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">现在有了新的选择，当然值得重新算算这笔账。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 4 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &q